OL,3,GNEWSADel Boy or Custard Cream? Capybara
OL,4,Apups to be named
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being asked to suggest names
OL,7,Ffor eight capybara pups that were born
OL,8,Fon the Isle of Man five weeks ago.
OL,10,FThe manager at Curraghs Wildlife Park
OL,11,Fsaid naming animals helped people
OL,12,F"identify" with them and "care about
OL,13,Fwhat is happening to them in the wild".
OL,15,FKathleen Graham said the five boys and
OL,16,Fthree girls would be named around four
OL,17,Fthemes, either Manx place names, South
OL,18,FAmerican names, biscuit names or Only
OL,19,FFools and Horses characters.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
